WEBVTT

00:00.507 --> 00:02.884
JULY 15TH (THURS) 4:43 PM

00:03.259 --> 00:05.261
It's open. Come in.

00:06.137 --> 00:07.721
Rohan-sensei?

00:07.764 --> 00:08.681
Where…

00:08.723 --> 00:10.433
I'm here, Koichi.

00:12.101 --> 00:13.519
Rohan-sensei!

00:13.561 --> 00:17.856
What's wrong? You didn't mention
any of this over the phone…

00:17.982 --> 00:19.733
I need your help.

00:20.151 --> 00:22.069
An enemy Stand has its hold on me.

00:22.195 --> 00:23.070
What?!

00:23.112 --> 00:26.240
A S-Stand? Where is it? Where?!

00:26.658 --> 00:29.786
It's on my back.
It's adhered itself to my back.

00:29.953 --> 00:31.120
Your back?

00:33.998 --> 00:37.001
Um… So this thing has
taken hold of your back?

00:37.502 --> 00:41.964
Yes. This is very serious,
and I'm not sure what to do.

00:42.006 --> 00:43.757
Could you show it to me?

00:43.925 --> 00:44.967
There's no way.

00:46.135 --> 00:47.970
But if you don't show it to me…

00:48.012 --> 00:50.931
If I expose my back,
it'll kill me and take hold of you.

00:51.099 --> 00:53.226
Quickly, burn them, yes?

00:53.309 --> 00:55.019
See? It's talking!

00:55.103 --> 00:56.145
This is what
I'm talking about, Koichi!

00:56.229 --> 00:57.230
Huh?

00:57.897 --> 00:59.815
Why are you hiding it?!

01:00.400 --> 01:03.069
Is this all just some big joke?

01:03.111 --> 01:04.320
How could you say that?!

01:04.404 --> 01:07.031
I told you,
if I expose my back to you I die!

01:07.115 --> 01:10.993
But how do I know you're not just
pulling my leg like you always do.

01:12.120 --> 01:13.871
That is what you're up to, right…

01:13.955 --> 01:15.998
No! I'm being dead serious!

01:16.040 --> 01:17.499
There's a dead body upstairs!

01:17.625 --> 01:19.752
Huh? A dead body?!

01:20.295 --> 01:23.715
Um… What are you doing, Sensei?

01:23.798 --> 01:26.175
Just step around me
and go on ahead.

01:26.467 --> 01:29.553
Please, please, go ahead. Please!

01:29.804 --> 01:32.014
What is all this about?

01:32.640 --> 01:34.683
Well? Now do you believe me?

01:36.269 --> 01:37.061
It's gone!

01:37.145 --> 01:39.147
There's no way…

01:39.188 --> 01:40.606
He's right here, Koichi!

01:45.403 --> 01:48.739
Look, Koichi!
This is Masazo Kinoto!

01:48.990 --> 01:51.534
He's been turned into
a lifeless husk!

01:51.659 --> 01:54.703
Wow, that's some impressive work.

01:55.496 --> 01:56.455
You know,

01:56.497 --> 01:59.750
this isn't exactly the time
to be horsing around, Sensei!

01:59.917 --> 02:02.044
Those Stand users the old man
in the photograph made

02:02.086 --> 02:04.713
are trying to hunt us down
as we speak.

02:04.756 --> 02:06.549
I rushed all the way over here

02:06.591 --> 02:08.843
because I was worried something
may've happened to you!

02:08.968 --> 02:09.969
What?

02:10.011 --> 02:11.262
Then this thing…

02:12.347 --> 02:14.515
Anyway, just be careful.

02:15.099 --> 02:15.724
Bye.

02:15.725 --> 02:17.560
W-Wait, Koichi!

02:17.602 --> 02:20.229
I called you over here
because I knew those pieces of shit

02:20.313 --> 02:23.065
Josuke and Okuyasu would
have another moronic laugh fest!

02:23.483 --> 02:26.569
You have to believe me!
I thought we were friends!

02:26.778 --> 02:28.988
Koichi!

02:30.114 --> 02:32.241
Cheer up now, yes?

02:32.283 --> 02:34.952
It's natural to be
a little disheartened…

02:35.703 --> 02:39.832
I have never been
more humiliated in my life…

02:40.208 --> 02:43.169
You bastard. You'll pay for this…

02:45.380 --> 02:47.090
<i>Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

02:47.757 --> 02:49.884
<i>(Listen up)
Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

02:50.635 --> 02:52.595
<i>(Listen)
Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

02:53.846 --> 02:56.932
<i>Breakdown, Breakdown
(3, 2, 1) Let's Go!</i>

02:56.974 --> 02:58.100
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

02:58.184 --> 03:02.684
<i>Shining Justice begins to sprout</i>

03:03.731 --> 03:08.231
<i>Brand-new bed town
Will we meet? Let's find out</i>

03:09.404 --> 03:13.904
<i>Feeling the sea breeze from the cape
through the tunnel to the tower</i>

03:14.992 --> 03:19.492
<i>We wander into the alley,
drawn to each other</i>

03:20.289 --> 03:24.789
<i>A shadow melts into our hearts</i>

03:27.672 --> 03:32.172
<i>But the golden spirits
shine a light to protect us</i>
